  "description": "<div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ldbrv-79elbk h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-ldbrv-1n7m0yu\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-9\">\r\n<div class=\"w-full text-token-text-primary\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-3\">\r\n<div class=\"px-4 py-2 justify-center text-base md:gap-6 m-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-1 text-base mx-auto gap-3 juice:gap-4 juice:md:gap-6 md:px-5 lg:px-1 xl:px-5 md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-[40rem] xl:max-w-[48rem]\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex w-full flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\r\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"343d062b-b0c6-40b1-9af4-659ade4a24e9\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start gap-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 overflow-x-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n<p>Welcome to our store, where every product is podiatrist developed with care and expertise. As foot specialists, we understand the unique needs of your feet and ankles, which is why our range of products is meticulously crafted to provide the utmost comfort and support.</p>\r\n<p>At our store, you'll find a comprehensive selection of foot and ankle care products, all formulated by foot doctors who are dedicated to ensuring your feet receive the attention they deserve. From everyday wellness essentials to specialized care solutions, each item is made with love and attention to detail.</p>\r\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to eco-friendly practices and high-quality materials. We believe in offering products that not only support your foot health but also contribute to the well-being of the planet. With our eco-conscious approach, you can shop confidently knowing that you're making a positive impact on both your health and the environment.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you're seeking relief from foot discomfort, looking to enhance your daily comfort, or in need of specialized care, our store excels in providing innovative solutions tailored to your needs. Experience the difference that podiatrist-developed products can make in your foot and ankle health journey.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-gray-400 flex self-end lg:self-center items-center justify-center lg:justify-start mt-0 -ml-1 h-7 gap-[2px] visible\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md p-1 text-xs text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-md\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12 3.5C10.8954 3.5 10 4.39543 10 5.5H14C14 4.39543 13.1046 3.5 12 3.5ZM8.53513 3.5C9.22675 2.3044 10.5194 1.5 12 1.5C13.4806 1.5 14.7733 2.3044 15.4649 3.5H17.25C18.9069 3.5 20.25 4.84315 20.25 6.5V18.5C20.25 20.1569 19.1569 21.5 17.25 21.5H6.75C5.09315 21.5 3.75 20.1569 3.75 18.5V6.5C3.75 4.84315 5.09315 3.5 6.75 3.5H8.53513ZM8 5.5H6.75C6.19772 5.5 5.75 5.94772 5.75 6.5V18.5C5.75 19.0523 6.19772 19.5 6.75 19.5H17.25C18.0523 19.5 18.25 19.0523 18.25 18.5V6.5C18.25 5.94772 17.8023 5.5 17.25 5.5H16C16 6.60457 15.1046 7.5 14 7.5H10C8.89543 7.5 8 6.60457 8 5.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></button></span>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-md\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.5 2.5C5.05228 2.5 5.5 2.94772 5.5 3.5V5.07196C7.19872 3.47759 9.48483 2.5 12 2.5C17.2467 2.5 21.5 6.75329 21.5 12C21.5 17.2467 17.2467 21.5 12 21.5C7.1307 21.5 3.11828 17.8375 2.565 13.1164C2.50071 12.5679 2.89327 12.0711 3.4418 12.0068C3.99033 11.942